// Title: Non-privileged Usage of Reg or Powershell
// ID: 8f02c935-effe-45b3-8fc9-ef8696a9e41d
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Teymur Kheirkhabarov (idea), Ryan Plas (rule), oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-05
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1112
// Description: Search for usage of reg or Powershell by non-privileged users to modify service configuration in registry
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "reg ") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "add"))) OR ((where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "powershell") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "set-itemproperty") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS " sp ") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "new-itemproperty")))) AND ((where(IntegrityLevel = "Medium") OR where(IntegrityLevel = "S-1-16-8192")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "ControlSet") AND where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "Services")) AND (where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "ImagePath") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "FailureCommand") OR where(CommandLine ICONTAINS "ServiceDLL"))))
